{"w": 595.3200073242188, "h": 809.0257568359375, "lines": [{"t": "136", "x": 0.8953504215774838, "y": 0.9742087522985531, "w": 0.03839282702615196, "h": 0.017428414981790374, "c": 1, "size": 12.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "Questions 37-40", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.1613150258338729, "w": 0.17786226346596065, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": true}, {"t": "Complete the summary below.", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.1896453759080105, "w": 0.3032575356097359, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "Choose ONE WORD ONLY from the passage for each answer.", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.21797572598214812, "w": 0.6115455349716206, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": true}, {"t": "Unintended ecological effects of using guard dogs", "x": 0.25562721024576973, "y": 0.2746735439806541, "w": 0.5295453848750882, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": true}, {"t": "In Namibia, livestock guard dogs have been used to protect domestic animals from", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.3030039694975767, "w": 0.8262731318082336, "h": 0.018822616509687834, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "attacks by cheetahs.", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.33133430071101805, "w": 0.22061291365358643, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "This has led to a rise in the deaths of other predators, particularly 37 ............", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.3596646507851557, "w": 0.8268583442445515, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": true}, {"t": "In addition, it has been suggested that the dogs could have 38 ............", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.38799500085929334, "w": 0.8268583442445515, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": true}, {"t": "which may affect other species, and that they may reduce the amount of 39 ............", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.41632538865482344, "w": 0.8268583442445515, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": true}, {"t": "………………….. available to certain wild animals.", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.4446557764503536, "w": 0.4683788180164641, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "On the other hand, these dogs may help birds by protecting their nests. These", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.47301087175797835, "w": 0.8259029142000445, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "might otherwise be threatened by predators such as 40 ............", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.5013412218321159, "w": 0.746800503766613, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}], "source": "pdf text layer"}